                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a story about a merchant who died and for some screw up with his guardian angel went back in time when he was a 20 year old and now has a second chance in life.\n\nNow the premise itself it quite interesting but the plot is so rushed, so short, no world building, no attempt to make us care or explain the characters, nada. It just jumps from one scene to another and then boom, end.\n\nBasically it's not even worth it with a discount, just get it with a bundle if you're interested.",
